      "content": "hey... i need to ask u something weird. i think something is happening with me. like, every time i get really upset or even just super stressed at work, the lights in my cubicle start flickering. and yesterday i was so frustrated that my computer literally just shut off out of nowhere. is it possible i'm like... projecting some kind of kinetic energy through my nervous system or something? it feels so real.",
